{"v":4,"catch":"當您在豪宅中尋找贓物時，這是一場激烈的標籤遊戲！","desc":"\"MAPPY \"是NAMCO在1983年發行的一款動作遊戲。\n玩家控制MAPPY，一個熱情的、有責任心的警察，執行從一個豪宅中奪回被盜物品的任務。在奪回貨物的同時，避免被NYAMCO和MEWKIES抓到!\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-10-21","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e1c82db7e14650f0c3b93809f61b28ead808ba98a41f26650b0eadcdc0ece8bf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/08fe9d77c4c3c4946d4a400154c85d85516097e2d2cfb21443bf0f6a36ae13ad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e39f0216ae756fa408685b8c922be244c2c597bdf6adb66b2710e7028c5c1683.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1cca74772df240dccdc65baaffad49d65876bbfd9137504fa88a0afd60c266e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f646a7f65ed7552a7ec09e4559256a8b522e07ab9c90e171a2988f73b69bd162.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/140bbe91e9c83c35d24f945a10af3dd48556eb6626225be1ca8774db706edd6a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c5d015ad0000","dlc":[]}